OL,3,GNEWSASterts fan offers cash to keep the
OL,4,Adoors open
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Sterts charity, which is
OL,7,Fresponsible for the theatre and studio
OL,8,Fbuildings on Bodmin Moor, in Cornwall,
OL,9,Fhas been given a stay of execution
OL,10,Fafter a member offered a loan of
OL,11,F#20,000.
OL,13,FIn September the Sterts Community
OL,14,FInterest Company, its operational arm,
OL,15,Fwent into voluntary liquidation leaving
OL,16,Fa number of creditors unpaid.
OL,18,FThe Sterts Charity is still functioning
OL,19,Fbut before the loan offer was made it
OL,20,Fasked members at its AGM if it too
OL,21,Fshould go into administration owing to
OL,22,Fits current deficit of #12,000.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
