OL,3,GNEWSASterts fan offers cash to keep the
OL,4,Adoors open
OL,5,
OL,6,FMember Vickie Bishop, who offered the
OL,7,Floan, said: "I've kept the doors open
OL,8,Fand what it means is that for the next
OL,9,Ffive months they [theatre groups] can
OL,10,Fuse the facilities there."
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
